        {"zh": "别忽略了我。", "en": "Don't ignore me."},
        {"zh": "你瞄准的应该是我。", "en": "You should target me."},
        {"zh": "我的存在不容忽视。", "en": "I can't be ignored."},
        {"zh": "别错过我。", "en": "Don't miss me."},
        {"zh": "瞄准我，我是你的。", "en": "Target me, I'm yours."},
